-ris.net"/></citation></ref><ref id="B3"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zika</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Schulte In den Baumen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaye</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Brand</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ibarreta</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sample, data use and protection in biobanking in Europe: legal issues</article-title><source>Pharmacogenomics</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>773</fpage><lpage>81</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18518854</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2217/14622416.9.6.773</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B4"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Ley 15/1999, de 13 de Diciembre, de Protecci&#x000f3;n de datos de caracter personal</article-title><source>BOE N&#x000ba; 298</source><year>1999</year><fpage>43088</fpage><lpage>43099</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Ley 14/2007, de 3 de Julio, de Investigaci&#x000f3;n biom&#x000e9;dica</article-title><source>BOE n&#x000ba; 159</source><year>2007</year><fpage>28826</fpage><lpage>28848</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Riegman</surname><given-names>PH</given-names></name><name><surname>Dinjens</surname><given-names>WN</given-names></name><name><surname>Oosterhuis</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Biobanking for interdisciplinary clinical research</article-title><source>Pathobiology</source><year>2007</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>239</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17709966</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1159/000104451</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-ty